  "summary_zh": "這是冰島「少數」在短時間「爬高」的公路，我覺得這段公路，是整個冰島，除了西峽灣之外，最美的一段山路，建議是規畫一個特別的行程，從「埃伊爾斯塔濟」開始出發到「塞濟斯菲厄澤」。\n\n這段路開車要小心，是在短距離爬到非常亮的亮度，基本上是翻過一座山，不下雨、下雪，天氣良好下，都還要開 40 分鐘，若是積雪的話，這段山路開車時要格外小心。",
  "summary_en": "This road in Iceland is one of the few routes that quickly climbs to high elevations, offering stunning views. It is considered the most beautiful mountain road in Iceland outside of the West Fjords, and we recommend planning a special itinerary starting from Eyjafjallajökull and ending at Seyðisfjörður. Drive carefully on this short, steep stretch, especially in good weather when it takes about 40 minutes; if there is snow, exercise extra caution. There is a free parking area and a viewpoint, but no restroom facilities. Allocate about 60 minutes for the stop.",
